## Required tooling

These skills call out to real binaries. Run `vgv_ai doctor` to check them.

| tool | needed for |
| --- | --- |
| `dart` | analysis, formatting, tests, the Dart MCP server |
| `flutter` | Flutter projects and widget tests |
| `very_good` | project scaffolding, test runs, license checks |
| `node` and `npx` | the context7 documentation MCP server |
| `gh` | opening and reviewing pull requests |

